#: ../../extend/moderator.md:1
msgid "内容审核（moderator）"
msgstr "Content moderation (moderator)"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:3
msgid ""
"审核钩子对**已经入库**的图片给出「通过 / 拦截」结论，属于**先发后审**：上传接口 （`POST "
"/api/v2/upload`）完全不受影响，判定由定时任务扫描完成。慢的外部内容安全 API、 限流与重试都在扫描里消化，不会拖慢用户上传。"
msgstr ""
"A moderation hook gives a pass / block verdict on images that are "
"**already stored**, so this is **review-after-publish**: the upload "
"endpoint (`POST /api/v2/upload`) is not affected at all, and a scheduled "
"scan does the judging. Slow external moderation APIs, rate limits and "
"retries are absorbed by the scan and never slow a user's upload."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:8
msgid ""
"拦截**只隐藏、不删除**。`block` 只是把图片从公开口径里摘出去（本人与管理员仍可见）， "
"删掉记录是管理员看过之后的明确动作。钩子本身**不允许**改库或删对象。"
msgstr ""
"A block **only hides, never deletes**. `block` just takes the image out "
"of the public surface (owner and admins still see it); removing the row "
"is an explicit action an admin takes after looking at it. Hooks "
"themselves are **not allowed** to touch the database or delete objects."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:12
msgid "声明与必需函数"
msgstr "Declaration and required functions"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:21
msgid ""
"`moderator` 只有一个必需函数 `review_image`；缺它时钩子清单的 `warnings` 会写 「moderator is "
"missing required function: review_image」，后台钩子页可见。"
msgstr ""
"`moderator` has exactly one required function, `review_image`; without it"
" the hook listing's `warnings` says “moderator is missing required "
"function: review_image”, visible on the admin hooks page."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:24
msgid "入参：`image`"
msgstr "Input: `image`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "键"
msgstr "Key"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`id` / `sha`"
msgstr "`id` / `sha`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "行 id 与公开标识（`/raw/<sha>`）"
msgstr "Row id and public identifier (`/raw/<sha>`)"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`filename` / `title` / `mime` / `size`"
msgstr "`filename` / `title` / `mime` / `size`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "元数据"
msgstr "Metadata"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`width` / `height` / `is_video`"
msgstr "`width` / `height` / `is_video`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "尺寸与是否视频（视频同样送审，由钩子自己决定跳过）"
msgstr ""
"Dimensions and whether it is a video (videos are submitted too; skip them"
" in the hook if you do not want that)"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`owner_id` / `album_id` / `created_at`"
msgstr "`owner_id` / `album_id` / `created_at`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "归属与上传时间；匿名上传的 `owner_id` 为 `null`"
msgstr "Ownership and upload time; `owner_id` is `null` for anonymous uploads"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`src`"
msgstr "`src`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "站内路径 `/raw/<sha>`"
msgstr "In-site path `/raw/<sha>`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`url`"
msgstr "`url`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid ""
"绝对地址：优先 `sapic_external_base_url + /raw/<sha>`，否则用登记的外链或公开副本直链（多数内容安全 API"
" 接受图片 URL）"
msgstr ""
"Absolute address: `sapic_external_base_url + /raw/<sha>` first, otherwise"
" a registered external link or a public replica URL (most moderation APIs"
" accept an image URL)"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:35
msgid ""
"`config` 是该钩子自己的配置（`hooks_config[<name>]`），字段由 `hook_manifest()` 的 "
"`config_schema` 声明，与其他钩子一致。"
msgstr ""
"`config` is the hook's own configuration (`hooks_config[<name>]`), whose "
"fields are declared by `config_schema` in `hook_manifest()` like any "
"other hook."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:38
msgid ""
"私有图（单图或继承相册）不会进入审核队列，交给钩子的只有公开可见的图片。 三种地址都拿不到时 `url` "
"仍可能为空，钩子应返回「判不了」让下一轮重试，别猜 `pass`。"
msgstr ""
"Private images (either the image override or inherited from the album) "
"never enter the moderation queue; only publicly visible images reach "
"hooks. If all three address sources are empty, `url` is still blank — "
"return \"no verdict\" so the next round retries instead of guessing "
"`pass`."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:41
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Return value"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "必需"
msgstr "Required"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`code`"
msgstr "`code`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "✅"
msgstr "✅"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`0` 表示本次判定有效；非 0 表示「这次判不了」（超时、配额、服务异常）"
msgstr ""
"`0` means the verdict is usable; non-zero means “cannot judge this time” "
"(timeout, quota, service error)"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`verdict`"
msgstr "`verdict`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "✅（`code` 为 0 时）"
msgstr "✅ (when `code` is 0)"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`pass` 或 `block`，其它值按「判不了」处理"
msgstr "`pass` or `block`; any other value is treated as “cannot judge”"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`message`"
msgstr "`message`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "简短原因，写进 `images.review_note`（截断 255），管理员在队列里能看到"
msgstr ""
"Short reason, written to `images.review_note` (truncated to 255) and "
"shown to admins in the queue"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:53
msgid "多个审核钩子并用时的合并规则："
msgstr "Merge rules when several moderation hooks are enabled:"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:55
msgid "**任一 `block` 即 block**（一个审核方说有问题就拦）；"
msgstr "**Any `block` wins** (one reviewer reporting a problem blocks the image);"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:56
msgid "没有任何 `block`，但存在 `code != 0` 或未知 `verdict` → **不落结论**，下一轮重试；"
msgstr ""
"no `block` but some `code != 0` or unknown `verdict` → **no verdict is "
"recorded**, the image is retried next round;"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:57
msgid "全部有效且都 `pass` 才算 `pass`。"
msgstr "only when every hook is valid and says `pass` is the image marked `pass`."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:59
msgid "失败时不会猜 `pass`：宁可多扫一轮，也不放行。"
msgstr ""
"Failures never guess `pass`: scanning one more round is cheaper than "
"letting something through."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:61
msgid "执行"
msgstr "Running it"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:63
msgid ""
"**默认自动跑**：服务启动后由进程内 APScheduler 每 `SCHEDULER_REVIEW_INTERVAL`（默认 300s） "
"扫一次，多 worker 用 `data/scheduler.lock` 选主，只有一个进程真正执行，所以不需要 cron。 调度细节见[部署 ·"
" 后台任务](../deploy.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**It runs automatically by default**: after the service starts, the in-"
"process APScheduler scans every `SCHEDULER_REVIEW_INTERVAL` (300s by "
"default); several workers elect a leader through `data/scheduler.lock`, "
"so only one of them really runs it and no cron is needed. See [deployment"
" · background jobs](../deploy.md) for the scheduling details."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:67
msgid "手动跑一批（默认 50 张，输出统计）："
msgstr "Run one batch by hand (50 images by default, prints statistics):"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:74
msgid ""
"只处理 `status=enabled` 且**尚无结论**的图片，按上传时间从旧到新。每行用一条 `UPDATE ... WHERE "
"review_state IS NULL` 原子抢占，多进程同时跑也不会重复判定 （重复调用意味着重复计费）。判定卡在 `running` 超过 "
"10 分钟（进程被杀）会重新入队。"
msgstr ""
"Only images with `status=enabled` and **no verdict yet** are processed, "
"oldest upload first. Each row is claimed atomically with an `UPDATE ... "
"WHERE review_state IS NULL`, so concurrent processes never judge the same"
" image twice (a duplicate call costs money twice). A row stuck in "
"`running` for more than 10 minutes (the process was killed) is queued "
"again."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:78
msgid ""
"完全不想用内置调度器时（例如已经有了统一的作业系统）：web 端设 `sapic_scheduler=0`， 用 `flask sa "
"scheduler` 或自己的 cron 调 `sa review-pending`："
msgstr ""
"If you do not want the built-in scheduler at all (for example you already"
" have a central job system): set `sapic_scheduler=0` on the web side and "
"let `flask sa scheduler` or your own cron call `sa review-pending`:"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:85
msgid "结论与管理员处理"
msgstr "Verdicts and admin handling"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:87
msgid "`images.review_state`："
msgstr "`images.review_state`:"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "值"
msgstr "Value"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`NULL`"
msgstr "`NULL`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "未审（含判定失败待重试）"
msgstr "Not reviewed (including failed verdicts waiting for a retry)"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`running`"
msgstr "`running`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "某一轮扫描正在处理（短窗口）"
msgstr "A scan round is processing it (short window)"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`pass`"
msgstr "`pass`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "通过，不再重扫"
msgstr "Passed, never rescanned"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`block`"
msgstr "`block`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "拦截：公开口径（`/raw` 的匿名访问、广场、公开列表）立即不可见"
msgstr ""
"Blocked: immediately invisible on the public surface (anonymous `/raw` "
"access, the plaza, public lists)"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:96
msgid "管理接口（均需 `admin`，不进 OpenAPI 文档）："
msgstr "Admin endpoints (all need `admin` and stay out of the OpenAPI document):"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "方法"
msgstr "Method"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "路径"
msgstr "Path"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "GET"
msgstr "GET"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`/api/v2/review?state=block`"
msgstr "`/api/v2/review?state=block`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid ""
"队列列表，`state` = `block`（默认）/ `pass` / `pending` / `all`，支持 `page` / "
"`page_size`"
msgstr ""
"Queue listing; `state` = `block` (default) / `pass` / `pending` / `all`, "
"with `page` / `page_size`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "POST"
msgstr "POST"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`/api/v2/review/<sha>`"
msgstr "`/api/v2/review/<sha>`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{\"action\": \"approve\", \"note\": \"误判\"}` 恢复公开；`{\"action\": "
"\"block\"}` 维持拦截；`{\"action\": \"purge\"}` **物理删除**（副本与行一起消失，不可恢复）"
msgstr ""
"`{\"action\": \"approve\", \"note\": \"wrong call\"}` restores the image;"
" `{\"action\": \"block\"}` keeps it blocked; `{\"action\": \"purge\"}` "
"**deletes it physically** (copies and row gone, unrecoverable)"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
msgid "`/api/v2/review/batch`"
msgstr "`/api/v2/review/batch`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{\"action\": \"approve|block|purge\", \"shas\": [\"...\"]}` 批量处理，单次上限 "
"100 张，按 sha 去重；返回 `{\"action\": ..., \"affected\": n}`"
msgstr ""
"`{\"action\": \"approve|block|purge\", \"shas\": [\"...\"]}` processes a batch, "
"capped at 100 images per call and deduplicated by sha; returns "
"`{\"action\": ..., \"affected\": n}`"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:104
msgid ""
"`purge` 与过期清理走同一条路径（`libs/images.purge_image`），sha 不会被复用。 "
"后台「审核队列」页（`/admin/review`）把这张队列可视化，支持逐张与批量放行/删除。"
msgstr ""
"`purge` goes through the same path as the expiry sweep "
"(`libs/images.purge_image`), so a sha is never reused. The admin Review "
"queue page (`/admin/review`) visualizes this queue and supports approving "
"or purging images one by one or in bulk."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:107
msgid ""
"站点设置 `review_auto_purge`（默认关）打开后，扫描判定为 `block` 的图片会**立即被 purge** "
"（副本与行一起删除），不进队列等人复核。这是不可逆操作，误判无法放行挽回，只在能接受 直接删除的部署里开启；默认关闭时 `block` "
"只隐藏，由管理员在队列里看过再决定。"
msgstr ""
"When the site setting `review_auto_purge` is on (off by default), an image "
"judged `block` is **purged immediately** (replicas and row deleted) and never "
"enters the queue for review. This is irreversible — a false positive cannot "
"be approved back — so enable it only where direct deletion is acceptable. "
"With the default off, `block` only hides the image and an admin decides in "
"the queue."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:111
msgid "最小实现"
msgstr "Minimal implementation"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:164
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"装法与其他钩子一致：放进 `server/data/hooks/`，然后 `POST /api/v2/hooks/import "
"{\"module\": \"my_moderator\"}`，再到后台钩子页启用并填配置。"
msgstr ""
"Install it like any other hook: drop it into `server/data/hooks/`, call "
"`POST /api/v2/hooks/import {\"module\": \"my_moderator\"}`, then enable "
"and configure it on the admin hooks page."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:167
msgid "注意"
msgstr "Caveats"

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:169
msgid ""
"钩子跑在扫描进程里（`flask sa review-pending`），**不要**假设有请求上下文（没有 `request`、 没有 "
"`g`）；需要站点地址就读 `image[\"url\"]` 或自己的配置。"
msgstr ""
"Hooks run in the scan process (`flask sa review-pending`), so **do not** "
"assume a request context (no `request`, no `g`); read the site address "
"from `image[\"url\"]` or from your own configuration."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:171
msgid "单张判定要自己设超时；整批的吞吐由 `-n` 与 cron 频率控制，核心不并发调用审核钩子。"
msgstr ""
"Set your own timeout for a single verdict; batch throughput is controlled"
" by `-n` and the cron frequency, and the core never calls moderation "
"hooks concurrently."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:172
msgid "返回 `block` 之前**不要**自行改库；判定结果由核心统一写入，管理员处理也只走 `/review` 接口。"
msgstr ""
"**Do not** write to the database before returning `block`; verdicts are "
"recorded by the core, and admin actions only go through the `/review` "
"endpoints."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:173
msgid "视频默认也会送审（`is_video` 为 `true`）；不想审就按示例直接返回 `pass`。"
msgstr ""
"Videos are submitted too (`is_video` is `true`); return `pass` as in the "
"example if you do not want to review them."

#: ../../extend/moderator.md:174
msgid ""
"`block` 收口的是**本站入口**（`/raw` 的匿名访问、公开列表、广场），不是\"内容撤回\"： 如果存储后端是公有读桶，`src` "
"那条 CDN 直链仍然可访问，彻底撤回只能由管理员 `purge`（删对象）或调整桶权限。要强约束就把后端设成 "
"`visibility=private`， 所有读取都走 `/raw`。"
msgstr ""
"`block` closes off **this site's entry points** (anonymous `/raw`, public"
" lists, the plaza); it is not a “content retraction”: with a public-read "
"bucket the CDN link in `src` still works, so a full retraction needs an "
"admin `purge` (delete the object) or a bucket policy change. For a hard "
"guarantee set the backend to `visibility=private` and route every read "
"through `/raw`."

